in public, she can't help but do that out of habit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Official Twitter Account"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91334"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近頃人気が出始めたアイドルユニット『グロリア＊スノウ』のナンバー2。頑張り屋さん。 ひょんなことから主人公を意識し始めるが、推しが自分ではなく同じユニットのライバル由奈であり、 その後対抗意識もあってか、さらに主人公に絡むようになるが、いまだ後輩の域を抜けられていない。 持ち前の演技力を駆使してあざとく優位に立ち回ろうとするが、それを徹底できない甘さに苦戦を強いられることに。 元国民的大女優である紫苑が母親で、人前ではママと呼ばないようにしているが、つい癖で呼んでしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22802","sourceWorkId":"29724","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近頃人気が出始めたアイドルユニット『グロリア＊スノウ』のナンバー2。頑張り屋さん。 ひょんなことから主人公を意識し始めるが、推しが自分ではなく同じユニットのライバル由奈であり、 その後対抗意識もあってか、さらに主人公に絡むようになるが、いまだ後輩の域を抜けられていない。 持ち前の演技力を駆使してあざとく優位に立ち回ろうとするが、それを徹底できない甘さに苦戦を強いられることに。 元国民的大女優である紫苑が母親で、人前ではママと呼ばないようにしているが、つい癖で呼んでしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77736"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63f1d12efb6b5ded7f5423ac545b226e69af649aa61f7929eae5b34fd6db3e17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b6a1eaf66090c72fe2a2f062881599df6d25f9ddd7d63b7354fe611ead5004f.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷口夢奈","creatorId":"vndb:s14335","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14335","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14335","name":"谷口 夢奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:325933:77736:29570:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91335","characterName":"ファッションメンヘラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77735","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"308573"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22801"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91335"},"originalCharacterName":"ファッションメンヘラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"813"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"144"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once she considers someone to be an enemy, she'll use her indifferent tone of voice and won't go easy on them. She loves her brother but even if she says it directly, it tends to not get through to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Recently, things have somehow started to get steamy around her brother and it's really getting on her nerves. She tries to use her position as the younger sister to her advantage as much as she can, but often, things don't go smoothly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't have many friends, but for some reason she's good friends with Ai, even though they don't really match well with each other. For now, she's still a harmless fashion maniac."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Official Twitter Account"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91335"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淡々とした口調で、一度敵と見なした相手には容赦のない毒舌妹。お兄ちゃん大好きだけど直接的に言ってもスルーされがち。 最近、兄の周りがなぜか急に色気付き始めたので、とても気が気じゃない。 妹という立場を最大限利用しようとするが、あまり上手くいかないことの方が多い。 あまり友達はいないが、なぜかまったく気の合いそうにない愛と仲良し。 今の所はまだ害のないファッションメンヘラ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22801","sourceWorkId":"29724","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淡々とした口調で、一度敵と見なした相手には容赦のない毒舌妹。お兄ちゃん大好きだけど直接的に言ってもスルーされがち。 最近、兄の周りがなぜか急に色気付き始めたので、とても気が気じゃない。 妹という立場を最大限利用しようとするが、あまり上手くいかないことの方が多い。 あまり友達はいないが、なぜかまったく気の合いそうにない愛と仲良し。 今の所はまだ害のないファッションメンヘラ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77735"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d59aed06577540a6609b9542ac07a9c461fbcc2b912b995c31f71cad86e2e6c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9f36010a464b2a2eab5fb3a3a8cf3a1acc372f9d3129013736565fadeb4be36.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"門脇舞以","creatorId":"vndb:s440","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s440","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s440","name":"門脇 舞以","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:325933:77735:4402:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91336","characterName":"おっぱい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77734","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"308573"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22800"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91336"},"originalCharacterName":"おっぱい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"421"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"94"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The student council president of the school the protagonist attends. She is born into a prominent family and is the daughter of the school's executive director."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is always at the top of her class, has a fine figure, and seems to be picture-perfect and beautiful girl. But in reality, she is an extreme narcissist with too many faults in her personality and is obsessed with her perfect self."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is popular and is often confessed to by male students, but when it comes to love, she's completely useless. She lives with Ao, the vice president of the school and her maid, and they have a sisterly relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Official Twitter Account"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91336"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通う学園の生徒会長。名家の生まれであり、理事長の娘。 常に学年トップの秀才で容姿端麗、絵に描いたような理想の美少女。実際はそんな完璧な自分に溺れている、性格に難が有りすぎる超絶ナルシスト。 モテモテでよく男子学生から告白されるものの、恋愛に関しては完全にポンコツ。 副会長でメイドでもある蒼とは二人暮らし。もはや姉妹のような関係。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22800","sourceWorkId":"29724","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通う学園の生徒会長。名家の生まれであり、理事長の娘。 常に学年トップの秀才で容姿端麗、絵に描いたような理想の美少女。実際はそんな完璧な自分に溺れている、性格に難が有りすぎる超絶ナルシスト。 モテモテでよく男子学生から告白されるものの、恋愛に関しては完全にポンコツ。 副会長でメイドでもある蒼とは二人暮らし。もはや姉妹のような関係。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77734"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b6d4c32a9464582344c16e0964548e799c91cda971b7d38755f60440c95144da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c13d7e4ba73192ed4a4478f51711345d75f7390acdb628685575cdab80965af.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白月 かなめ","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86715","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91337","characterName":"ピンク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77733","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"308573"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22799"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91337"},"originalCharacterName":"ピンク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1225"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An innocent simpleton who suddenly transfers to the school. During her introduction on her first day, she unexpectedly confesses to the protagonist. Furthermore, she calls herself his childhood friend, but his memory of that is vague, so it's unclear whether that's true or not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Moreover, she becomes a freeloader at the protagonist's house. Due to her parents transferring for work in the past, her communication skills are strong, so she's able to make friends, but it doesn't seem that she has any longtime friends who she keeps in contact with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In any case, although the reason may be unclear, she is a single-minded girl who, due to liking the protagonist, will not be discouraged and often makes moves on him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Official Twitter Account"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91337"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いきなり転校してきた天真爛漫なアホ娘。転校初日の挨拶で主人公にいきなり告白をかます。その上、幼馴染みだと言うが、本人の記憶があやふやなので真偽は不明。さらに主人公の家に居候することになる。 昔から両親が転勤族なため、コミュ力自体は高いので友達はできるがずっと連絡を取り合うような親友がいない。 とにかく理由は定かではないが主人公が好きなため、めげずに何度もアタックしてくる一途な娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22799","sourceWorkId":"29724","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いきなり転校してきた天真爛漫なアホ娘。転校初日の挨拶で主人公にいきなり告白をかます。その上、幼馴染みだと言うが、本人の記憶があやふやなので真偽は不明。さらに主人公の家に居候することになる。 昔から両親が転勤族なため、コミュ力自体は高いので友達はできるがずっと連絡を取り合うような親友がいない。 とにかく理由は定かではないが主人公が好きなため、めげずに何度もアタックしてく